    <briefdescription>
<para>Called when a hidden actor is shown to a player. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This event is only called when the actor&apos;s visibility status is actually changed. It is called regardless of whether the actor is within the player&apos;s tracking range.</para>
